        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-23T02:27:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I hadn't thought of it before now, but I agree with the energy icon. Just in a different way. The shape is what throws me. At a glance, it's actually hard to distinguish between the Energy and Defense icons. Unless I'm just having difficulty because of the print on my playtesting copy.</p>",
