        "created_at": "2013-04-23T14:24:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I figured that's the reason for it, which is why I wanted to point out that that's the opposite thinking from what you'd need for really good icon design. &nbsp;An icon that looks kind of like two other icons is laying down on the job, icon-wise. ;) &nbsp;It needs to stand on its own.</p>",
